he same slug in all five locales and so pair by path with no key needed.","headings":["About","About"]},{"title":"Untitled","url":"/en/index.html","content":"Skip to main content Skip to content FeaturesPostsExplore by tagContact Us 🇬🇧 English 🇫🇷 Français 🇸🇦 العربية 🇧🇩 বাংলা 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇪🇸 Español 🇳🇬 Hausa 🇮🇱 עברית 🇮🇳 हिन्दी 🇮🇩 Indonesia 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇵🇱 Polski 🇵🇹 Português 🇷🇴 Română 🇷🇺 Русский 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇵🇭 Filipino 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇺🇦 Українська 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇳🇬 Yorùbá 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文 Home>English — Notes on index English — Notes on index English 5 posts available in English. This file demonstrates the nested-locale content shape: content/<lang>/<slug>.md and content/<lang>/index.md.","headings":["English — Notes on index","English"]},{"title":"Untitled","url":"/en/post-1/index.html","content":"Skip to main content Skip to content FeaturesPostsExplore by tagContact Us 🇬🇧 English 🇫🇷 Français 🇸🇦 العربية 🇧🇩 বাংলা 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇪🇸 Español 🇳🇬 Hausa 🇮🇱 עברית 🇮🇳 हिन्दी 🇮🇩 Indonesia 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇵🇱 Polski 🇵🇹 Português 🇷🇴 Română 🇷🇺 Русский 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇵🇭 Filipino 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇺🇦 Українська 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇳🇬 Yorùbá 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文 Home>Notes on rust Notes on rust Notes on rust These are working notes on rust. Post 1 of the English corpus. Identical structure across all 5 locales, so the staticdatagen recursive walk has 30 files total to discover.","headings":["Notes on rust","Notes on rust"]},{"title":"Untitled","url":"/en/post-2/index.html","content":"Skip to main content Skip to content FeaturesPostsExplore by tagContact Us 🇬🇧 English 🇫🇷 Français 🇸🇦 العربية 🇧🇩 বাংলা 🇨🇿 Čeština 🇩🇪 Deutsch 🇪🇸 Español 🇳🇬 Hausa 🇮🇱 עברית 🇮🇳 हिन्दी 🇮🇩 Indonesia 🇮🇹 Italiano 🇯🇵 日本語 🇰🇷 한국어 🇳🇱 Nederlands 🇵🇱 Polski 🇵🇹 Português 🇷🇴 Română 🇷🇺 Русский 🇸🇪 Svenska 🇹🇭 ไทย 🇵🇭 Filipino 🇹🇷 Türkçe 🇺🇦 Українська 🇻🇳 Tiếng Việt 🇳🇬 Yorùbá 🇨🇳 简体中文 🇹🇼 繁體中文 Home>Notes on typescript Notes on typescript Notes on typescript These are working notes